  "hindi": "समुद्र से मधुर लहर ऊपर उठी है; चुपचाप उसने अमरत्व को प्राप्त किया है। घी का जो गुप्त नाम है, वह देवों की जीभ है, अमरत्व की नाभि है।",
  "english": "From the sea the honeyed wave has risen up; quietly it has reached immortality. The hidden name of ghee, which is, is the tongue of the gods, the navel of immortality.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "upāṃśunā, instrumental of upāṃśu, rendered 'quietly' (literally 'in a whisper'); the subject of ānaṭ is taken to be the wave. amṛtasya could also be read as 'of the immortal (nectar)'. nāma ... yad asti: 'which is' attaches to the name.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
