  "hindi": "तीन प्रकार से रखा हुआ, पणियों द्वारा गुप्त किया जाता हुआ घी देवों ने गाय में पाया। इन्द्र ने एक उत्पन्न किया, सूर्य ने एक उत्पन्न किया; वेन से एक को उन्होंने स्वधा से गढ़ा।",
  "english": "The gods found the ghee, placed threefold, being hidden by the Paṇis, in the cow. Indra produced one, Sūrya produced one; from Vena they fashioned one by own power.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "Paṇi and Vena are kept as names. The 'one' produced by each is not specified. anu avindan: 'found' (anu-√vid). Whether 'in the cow' belongs with 'hidden' or 'found' is not settled.",
